      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `rotate_secret_version.py` that reads a specific secret version or staged value using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific cloud service provider. AWS Secrets Manager is a suitable choice for this task. The code will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS Secrets Manager. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of AWS-specific client methods. </thinking>\n",
