        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret from a concrete external provider. I will use AWS Secrets Manager as the provider, which is identifiable by the 'boto3' import and the 'secretsmanager' service name. </thinking>\n",
